{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1298214-making-stereotypes-of-the-traditions","id":1298214,"title":"Making Stereotypes *of* the Traditions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-03-20T16:16:18-07:00","id":1298214,"title":"Making Stereotypes *of* the Traditions","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">So M20 has each Traditions' stereotypes of the Sects, but I thought it would be cool to write up the reverse; so under the Hermetic view of the other Traditions, a stereotyped response from the Traditions essentially. The original text is from M20, the alternating lines are my own.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">Order of Hermes.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Fellow Traditions: \u201cDespite venerable practices and occasional insights, our allies lack the discipline to achieve lasting power or control. Even so, they have stood with us for centuries, so they remain worthy companions.\u201d</span></span><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Onacona &quot;White Owl&quot; of the Dreamspeakers: \u201cThey\u2019re completely full of themselves, and to some of them we\u2019re brainless savages who shouldn\u2019t be allowed to command power. With that said, they\u2019re at the core of the Traditions and when they manage to pull their heads out of their own asses they can be useful allies.\u201d</span></span></i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Technocracy: \u201cIn the end, only one of us will survive.\u201d</span></span><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Agent [Redacted] of the New World Order: \u201cA holdover from a bygone era. The ideals of reason evolved out of that old House; emphasis on \u2018out of\u2019. They\u2019re lagging a few hundred years behind the real world, and they might need our help realizing that.\u201d</span></span></i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Disparates: \u201cTalented amateurs, lost to their own separation.\u201d</span></span><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Sarah, Orphan: \u201cDid someone stick a white beard and some glitter on a Technocrat and hope we wouldn\u2019t notice?\u201d</span></span></i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11620,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","user":"twig","date":". 03-21-2019, 07:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-21T03:45:09-07:00","id":1298291,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Akashic Brotherhood</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Fellow Traditions: \u201cThe engaging illusions they construct distract them from the transcendence they strive to achieve.\u201d</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Anonymous Virtual Adept: \u201cThey go from 0 to 100 in no time at all. They always set me on edge; if you properly piss one off, you might not know until you\u2019re flat on the ground.\u201d</i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Technocracy: \u201cMetal dragons in a stifling box.\u201d</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Agent [Redacted] of the New World Order: \u201cPsychodynamics, martial arts and self-improvement, all dressed in layers of deviance and archaic practices. Thankfully they seem entirely committed to self-containment and irrelevance.\u201d</i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Disparates: \u201cLost children and broken relations\u2026 yet there\u2019s more to them than there might seem.\u201d</span></span><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Sarah, Orphan: \u201cLove Too Be Zen And Peaceful By Studying Violence.\u201d</span></span></i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11620,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","user":"twig","date":". 03-21-2019, 06:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-21T04:04:13-07:00","id":1298293,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>11twiggins</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1298214-making-stereotypes-of-the-traditions?p=1298291#post1298291\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anonymous Virtual Adept: \u201cThey go from 0 to 100 in no time at all. They always set me on edge; if you properly piss one off, you might not know until you\u2019re flat on the ground.\u201d</div> </div> </div> </div>That's very good.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-21T04:08:19-07:00","id":1298295,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Celestial Chorus</span><br /> <br /> Fellow Traditions: \u201cMy Father\u2019s home hath many chambers.\u201d Though I might not understand them all\u2026 might even, God forgive me, hate a few\u2026 I choose to remember that we all receive Divinely guided grace.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Typical Hermetic: \u201cReliable in their compassion and honesty, if not always in their sense. Let them take the high road; after all, sometimes it leads to unpredictable victories.\u201d</i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Technocracy: Traitors to Grace who imprison the world with mechanical cacophony.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Progenitor Report: \u201cFaith healing? Religious mania? We\u2019re looking at an enormous deviant cult that seems devoted to undermining the miracle of modern medicine.\u201d</i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Disparates: Lost souls, one and all.</span></span><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Templar Devotee: \u201cI have seen HELL in the works of these heretics. There is one body, one Christ, one redemption. Their &quot;tolerant&quot; sacrilege borders on the satanic, and they will burn for their crimes.\u201d</span></span></i><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-21T04:09:08-07:00","id":1298296,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1298214-making-stereotypes-of-the-traditions?p=1298293#post1298293\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's very good.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! :-)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-21T04:36:13-07:00","id":1298300,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Cult of Ecstasy:</span><br /> <br /> Fellow Traditions: A bunch of tight-assed academics who\u2019re often scared to push beyond the obvious limits of their disciplines and embrace everything they could be on the other side of those expectations.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Anonymous Virtual Adept: \u201cA lot of the hate they get comes from losers not getting invited to all the cool parties. Unlike a lot of my peers I wash and shave, so you\u2019ll hear no complaints from me.\u201d</i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Technocracy: Abominations of the human condition, and the source of almost everything wrong today.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Syndicate Manager: \u201cSurprisingly good contractors... Just don\u2019t draw too much attention to them. When the time comes to cannibalize what\u2019s left of our competitors, I\u2019ll throw a few of these animals a liferaft. Sex sells, after all.\u201d</i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Disparates: I don\u2019t blame them for wanting their freedom. Too bad it\u2019s cost them almost everything else\u2026</span></span><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Sarah, Orphan: \u201cI met a beautiful dancer one night and... well I spent a few weeks following them around like an obedient little puppy. One night things got unusually wild, and it was like opening my eyes, and my body, for the first time. I\u2019ll never forget them... but I couldn\u2019t keep up with that lifestyle.\u201d</span></span></i><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-22T07:59:29-07:00","id":1298591,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Euthanatos</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Fellow Traditions: The most fascinating parade of visionaries, misfits, bastards, and heroes ever to walk the Earth and survive the experience for long.</span></span><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Sister Ariana the Spider, of the Verbena: \u201cWe\u2019re all part of this sacred cycle... and yet you seem to have a lot of assassins, murderers and morticians, and very few midwives. How very odd.\u201d</span></span></i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Technocracy: Slick pride-monsters taking a metallic dump on the Great Wheel.</span></span><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Director Hanson: \u201cYou think I have bodyguards to keep me safe from protesters? If only.\u201d</span></span></i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Disparates: Conventional wisdom says they\u2019re dead\u2026 but dead things have a way of coming back around.</span></span><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Sarah, Orphan: \u201cAncient students in the art of upsetting and killing people, then justifying it with pseudo-philosophy. All these entropic murder-obsessed bastards just HAPPEN to come to the conclusion that killing people is Good, Actually. Incredible.\u201d</span></span></i><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-22T08:14:10-07:00","id":1298592,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:22px\">Society of Ether:</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Fellow Traditions: Fascinating allies, I suppose\u2026 but they call us mad?</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Typical Adept: \u201cThe Union, plus enviable wonder and passion, minus the excess sanity.\u201d</i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Technocracy: Obscenities to the name of Science, perverting wonder into control.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>NWO Report: \u201cThese deviants are deceptive; don\u2019t fall for their claim to the word Science. They do not value repeatability, stable systematics, peer review or sanity. They are deviants who dress their deviance as mutualism, making them all the more dangerous.</i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Disparates: Footdraggers. Mysterious footdraggers, though. Certainly worthy of further study\u2026</span></span><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Hippolyta Recruiter: \u201cThey\u2019ll tell you they respect your work sister, but you know they want to bite their tongue when they say \u201csociety\u201d, and when they call you their peer. It\u2019s a boys club, kids playing with steam engines and silly toys. Nothing more, nothing less.\u201d</span></span></i><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-22T08:24:45-07:00","id":1298595,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:22px\">Verbena</span><br /> <br /> Fellow Traditions: We\u2019re siblings of the blood \u2013 quarreling, dysfunctional, often hating one another\u2019s guts\u2026 but we\u2019ll kick anyone else\u2019s ass if they mess with us. One for all, for better and worse.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Euthanatos Agent: \u201cTwo sides of a coin; they think we\u2019re unbalanced, but they don\u2019t realize that they\u2019re the counterweight.\u201d</i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Technocracy: Plain and simple, they\u2019re a disease.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Excerpt from personal note of a Progenitor Scientist: \u201cI hate these mystics. I really can\u2019t deny that. All their tree-hugging bullshit only damages my own conservation work by association.\u201d</i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Disparates: In the new Burning Times, I\u2019m afraid they\u2019ve been consumed.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Hippolyta Recruiter: \u201cWitch hunts were all about controlling women, destroying those of us who wouldn\u2019t conform. Nothing but respect for sisters who spit in the eye of the machine.\u201d</i></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-22T08:35:13-07:00","id":1298598,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:22px\">Virtual Adepts</span><br /> <br /> Fellow Traditions: Ghosts in the machine \u2013 noisy, cranky, old as fuck, but haunting nevertheless. There\u2019s so much they have to teach, and so much more they have to learn.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>\u201cTraditional\u201d Mystics: \u201cIt\u2019s life or death for us. We\u2019re fighting for survival, and they simply aren\u2019t. I don\u2019t think I can ever totally trust a group who have one foot in the world our enemies are trying to create...\u201d</i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Technocracy: We\u2019re at war for the heart of this world\u2026 and the next. So respect the allies but take no prisoners.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Agent [Redacted] of the New World Order: \u201cSymmetry in all things, I suppose. We had a timetable for mechanical advancement, and we are betrayed by a deviant cult. We had a timetable for digital advancement, and history just repeats itself.\u201d</i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Disparates: *singsong* I know a see-cret\u2026</span></span><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Sarah, Orphan: \u201cSometimes I feel like I\u2019m being watched. I\u2019ve started taping over my webcam, just to be safe.\u201d</span></span></i><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-22T12:45:48-07:00","id":1298706,"title":"","content":"You got me thinking about more in depth interactions between individual members, here is what I have for a SoE/Verbena mix:<br /> <br /> &quot;A fascinating lot. I have an archaeologist friend among them; she shared with me her translations of an ancient babylonian calendar. She was planning on communing with one of &quot;the old gods&quot; at the next conjunction. Initially she was furious when I asked to tag along to study the process. 'The only way you are joining is as a blood sacrifice.'<br /> <br /> &quot;Of course we worked it out in the end. I removed all the LEDs and buzzers from my gear and she only took half my liver. Diplomacy will get you everywhere, my friends.&quot;<br /> <br /> --Professor Algos, reminiscing in the opening of Paradigma<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;The funny thing was he thought the liver was some kind of payment. I would never have given him the calendar if I didn't mean for him to tag along. It's not good for that lot to be locked up in their labs for too long. If you can get them to look past their gadgets and come out here where things are real and vibrant, they really come alive...&quot;<br /> <br /> Professor Thame, to her apprentice/grad student","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: The Ice-ension: An Epic Game of Reality on the Rink","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/758-ramnesis","name":"Ramnesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-23T02:41:17-07:00","id":1298884,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:22px\">Dreamspeakers</span><br /> <br /> Fellow Traditions: Despite all their admirable qualities, I trust the ones I must, consider a rare few of them my friends, and keep eyes in the back of my head open for the next inevitable failure.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Victoria, Etherite: \u201cUncouth and shocking; and not unintentionally! Half of their power comes from inspiring fear and disgust in others. Deny them their power. Find nothing shocking.\u201d</i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Technocracy: The living essence of the White-mare.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Inner Circle Dispatch: \u201cThese pockets of deviance within indigenous communities demonstrate a worrying principle; local reality is defined by local belief. This is why we must step up our efforts to subvert, seduce and integrate these populations. Let them leave their old ways behind and join the modern world.\u201d</i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Disparates: I sense a trick here, and I think I like it\u2026</span></span><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Bata\u2019a Medicine-Worker: \u201cIt\u2019s sad, looking at the birds the Council have stuck in their cages.\u201d</span></span></i><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}